This repository includes Battle Drones, a browser strategy game.

  Name:    Battle Drones
  Authors: Simon Willison, Eli Albert, and commits authored by Claude
           (Anthropic), per the upstream git history
  Source:  https://github.com/simonw/battledrones
  Commit:  ca4f13b36013e1980289046e731a295d2bf02a3e
  License: Apache License 2.0
  Path:    games/battledrones/

Upstream carries no copyright line of its own and no NOTICE file. The game's
license is kept unchanged at games/battledrones/LICENSE.

Changes to the upstream tree: progress-shots/, research_notes/ and
package-lock.json are removed, and package.json gains the check, stage and
deploy scripts. Later changes are in this repository's git history.

The images the game ships were generated with an image model, except the HUD
portraits, which are renders of the game's 3D models (see
games/battledrones/ART.md).
